      "text": "唐僧从地上站起来说“我要到美丽的林中去散散步”，少女跳上前说“我跟你去”，三人正打成一团顾不上唐僧。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我要到美丽的林中去散散步"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-16",
      "text": "少女向唐僧自报姓名“我叫白晶晶”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "白晶晶"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我叫白晶晶"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-17",
      "text": "唐僧对白晶晶说“我们好像见过”，并说自己只在林子里走时才不用去想哪边才是西边。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我们好像见过"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-18",
      "text": "唐僧说去西天是因为太多人问过他，他“只是想知道它在哪儿”，并自认很傻。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我只是想知道它在哪儿"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-19",
      "text": "白晶晶看着唐僧背影时眼中忽现杀机，将手伸向他的背；唐僧忽然转回身，她低头装作修指甲——如此三度出手，均在中途收回或被打断。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "白晶晶"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "眼中忽现杀机"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-20",
      "text": "唐僧背向白晶晶说，他并不是不让他们吃，只不过要他们给他一个“理由”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我只不过是要他们给我个理由"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-21",
      "text": "唐僧自述：当年他把猴子从山底挖出来时，猴子有泥土恐惧症、最大愿望是脚不沾地在树上挂着，他用三个月逼猴子重新拿出勇气在地上走路。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我用了三个月逼他重新拿出勇气在地上走路"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-22",
      "text": "唐僧自述：一年后他遇上一只自卑的猪，当时那猪正因一个小姑娘疯狂想嫁给他、要和他一起去做妖精而痛苦，为了逃跑就混进了取经队伍。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一个小姑娘疯狂地想嫁给他"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-23",
      "text": "唐僧自述：他在河里救起沙僧，这沙僧五百年都没学会游泳，天帝却罚他在流沙河里当妖精，他只敢在河中心一块石头上站了五百年。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "可是天帝罚他在流沙河里当妖精"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-24",
      "text": "唐僧说三个徒弟现在每一个人都恨他，并推测自己若死了他们就会解脱。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "而现在他们每一个人都恨我"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-25",
      "text": "唐僧说所有的妖精都想杀他，他每次都问“为什么”，可每次对方还没说出答案就死了；因此他认为想杀死一个妖精，只要问他“为什么”就够了。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他们还没说出答案的时候就死了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-26",
      "text": "唐僧忽然一把抓住白晶晶的手，盯着她的眼睛大声喊“为什么”，白晶晶恐惧地大叫起来。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "唐僧忽然一把抓住白晶晶的手"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-27",
      "text": "白晶晶自述这是她成为妖精以来没被人这样注视过，觉得自己忽然又变回当年活着的那个小姑娘、在那眼神下透明；随后唐僧放开手，说“对不起，只是个玩笑”，并边走边说“没错，就当这一切只是个玩笑好了”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "对不起，只是个玩笑"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-28",
      "text": "白晶晶定神后仍将手变成利爪，但手在半空定住——孙悟空已站在她的背后。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "孙悟空站在了她的背后"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-29",
      "text": "白晶晶与孙悟空对视后镇定下来，指出“孙悟空，你本也是妖怪”，并让他杀了自己去成正果。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "白晶晶"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你本也是妖怪"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-30",
      "text": "孙悟空说“我不是，我要成正果了”，并说自己知道她换了人形、刚才已放她一马，而她仍想杀唐僧。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我刚才放你一马"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-31",
      "text": "白晶晶反问“你知道我是谁？杀我之前能不能告诉我？”，孙悟空抬起棒来时，她忽然向他伸出手。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "白晶晶"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "杀我之前能不能告诉我"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-32",
      "text": "白晶晶颤声说“如果有雨水，花果山就能长出花草来吧”，孙悟空愣住并念出“花果山”，随后只说出一个“痛”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "如果有雨水，花果山就能长出花草来吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-33",
      "text": "孙悟空忽然丢掉棒子，直蹦起来又摔在地上，抱头狂喊“痛，痛啊！”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "抱头狂喊"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-34",
      "text": "白晶晶抬头怒视唐僧质问“紧箍咒？”，但唐僧并没有念什么，只是平静地看着。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "唐僧并没有念什么"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-35",
      "text": "白晶晶说“孙悟空你忍住，我这就杀了唐僧”，冲上前去。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "白晶晶"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我这就杀了唐僧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-36",
      "text": "孙悟空跳起来一把抓住冲上前的白晶晶，白晶晶惊疑回头问“为什么”；唐僧出声喊“不要”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "但是孙悟空跳起来一把抓住了她"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-37",
      "text": "孙悟空的一击落在白晶晶身上，她的身躯在瞬间粉碎。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "瞬间那身躯也粉碎了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-38",
      "text": "孙悟空像苍老的人一样弓着腰、低头从唐僧身边走过；唐僧叹气让他把解开的行李整好搬上马，他低声应“知道了”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000057.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000057",
          "chapter_order": 57,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "把解开的行李整好搬上马"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    }
